WEBVTT

00:09:57.593 --> 00:10:01.263
and asked if they would volunteer
to teach some of the things

00:10:01.305 --> 00:10:03.724
that they love to do to others.

00:10:04.058 --> 00:10:07.102
And almost invariably they agreed.

00:10:07.770 --> 00:10:10.147
Bill himself taught two sessions,

00:10:10.189 --> 00:10:14.485
one on iPads and one on iPhones.

00:10:14.943 --> 00:10:17.237
Because we were smart enough to know

00:10:17.237 --> 00:10:20.824
that a number of our members
had been given these things

00:10:20.866 --> 00:10:25.579
as gifts at Christmas by their children

00:10:25.621 --> 00:10:27.915
and that they barely knew
how to turn them on.

00:10:27.915 --> 00:10:29.458
(Laughter)